        <div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1;">10</div>
        <div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.4;margin-top:4px;">Oct</div>
        <div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:#B8C4DE;line-height:1.4;">Sat</div>
      </td></tr></table>
    </td>
    <td valign="top" style="padding-left:16px;">
      <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;"><tr><td style="background-color:#EBF0FA;border-radius:12px;padding:3px 10px;font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#002771;">In person · Hands-on workshop</td></tr></table>
      <div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#002771;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 6px 0;">Build with AI: Hands-On Coding Workshop</div>
      <div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#03102F;line-height:1.6;">10am–5pm SGT<br/>Venue details on <a href="https://luma.com/ax6v7i9c" style="color:#2465DE;text-decoration:underline;">Luma</a></div>
