</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 24px 20px 24px;"><img src="img/hero.png" alt="HitPay and The Working Capitol" width="100%" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;border:0;" /></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 16px 24px;"><div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 6px 0;">Who it's for</div><div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">SME owners and operators who want to build useful software and automate business tasks. No developer background needed.</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 16px 24px;"><div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 6px 0;">What you'll take away</div><table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:8px;"><tr>
<td width="18" valign="top" style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.6;">&#10003;</td>
<td valign="top" style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;padding-left:6px;">How to use Claude as your AI coding co-pilot to build functional software</td>
</tr></table><table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:8px;"><tr>
<td width="18" valign="top" style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.6;">&#10003;</td>
<td valign="top" style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;padding-left:6px;">How to identify and automate a bottleneck in your business</td>
</tr></table><table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:0;"><tr>
<td width="18" valign="top" style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.6;">&#10003;</td>
<td valign="top" style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;padding-left:6px;">How to get started faster using HitPay's ready-made building blocks</td>
</tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 20px 24px;"><div style="background-color:#F5F7FC;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Bring a laptop and a Claude Pro account. <b style="color:#03102F;">Limited seats left.</b> Registration is subject to approval.</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 24px 24px;"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#2465DE" style="background-color:#2465DE;border-radius:6px;"><a href="https://luma.com/ax6v7i9c?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=sg-two-events-9-10-oct&amp;utm_content=2-register-for-the-workshop" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;">Register for the workshop →</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>
